  ],
  "notes": [
    "Geometry and hex colours come from the pinned Commons SVG; deq-spec lint checks every value here against it.",
    "Wikipedia's infobox lists RGB triples that do not match its own hex codes. The hex values used in the SVG are authoritative here; rgb, hsl, oklch and cmyk are computed from them.",
    "Pantone references are not verified from a primary source and are left null.",
    "CMYK values are a naive conversion for orientation only; print work needs a colour-managed conversion.",
    "The sun centre is 0.842 units below the flag's middle because the 21-ray star is taller above its centre (R) than below it (R cos(pi/21))."
  ]
